{"id": "7th-t3-u1-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u1-grammar-maathirai-mutruppoli-anju", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'அஞ்சு' என்னும் முற்றுப்போலிச் சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "1.5 மாத்திரை", "B": "2.5 மாத்திரை", "C": "2 மாத்திரை", "D": "3 மாத்திரை"}, "explanation": "'அஞ்சு' மாத்திரை பகுப்பாய்வு:\nஅ (குறில்) = 1 மாத்திரை\nஞ் (மெய்) = 0.5 மாத்திரை\nசு (வன்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்) = 0.5 மாத்திரை\nமொத்தம் = 1 + 0.5 + 0.5 = 2 மாத்திரை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the total prosodic metric count (Maathirai) for the Mutruppoli word 'Anju':"}], "options": {"A": "1.5 Maathirai", "B": "2.5 Maathirai", "C": "2 Maathirai", "D": "3 Maathirai"}, "explanation": "Metrics for 'Anju': A (short = 1) + nj (consonant = 0.5) + su (Kutriyalukaram = 0.5) = 2 Maathirai. Key C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": nu